# Invoice Management System — Backend

REST API backend for the Invoice Management System, built with Node.js, Express, and MongoDB.

## Tech Stack
- Node.js + Express.js
- MongoDB with Mongoose
- JWT Authentication
- bcrypt (password hashing)

## Features
- User registration & login (JWT protected)
- Create, read, update, delete invoices
- Public read-only invoice sharing via unique share link
- Automatic subtotal, tax, discount, and grand total calculation

## Setup Instructions

1. Clone the repository
```bash
   git clone <your-repo-url>
   cd backend
```

2. Install dependencies
```bash
   npm install
```

3. Create a `.env` file in the root directory (see `.env.example`) and fill in your values:
4. Run the development server
```bash
   npm run dev
```

The server will start on `http://localhost:5000`.

## API Endpoints

### Auth
| Method | Endpoint             | Description         |
|--------|-----------------------|----------------------|
| POST   | `/api/auth/register`  | Register a new user |
| POST   | `/api/auth/login`     | Login and get JWT   |

### Invoices (Protected — requires JWT)
| Method | Endpoint              | Description              |
|--------|------------------------|---------------------------|
| GET    | `/api/invoices`        | Get all invoices for user |
| GET    | `/api/invoice/:id`     | Get single invoice        |
| POST   | `/api/invoice`         | Create new invoice        |
| PUT    | `/api/invoice/:id`     | Update invoice             |
| DELETE | `/api/invoice/:id`     | Delete invoice             |

### Public
| Method | Endpoint                          | Description                    |
|--------|-------------------------------------|----------------------------------|
| GET    | `/api/public/invoice/:shareId`     | View invoice without login      |

